/* docsync:prune — to-document.mjs keeps only the rules a section uses. */
/* DocSync motion: step builds, self-drawing wires, travelling packets, icons, networks and growing bars.
   Applies inside .motion roots only. Hidden states need html.mo-js (added by motion.js), so script-free
   thumbnails, print and readers without JavaScript always see the final state.
